WEBVTT

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.100
My turn!

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:07.360
Hey, Wiz. We came to visit.

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:10.400
Kazuma-san! You're all here!

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:12.110
Welcome to the store.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:13.360
Pardon the intrusion.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.610
Why did we have to come 
to some undead's shop?

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:27.130
Y-You just saw me, didn't you?! 
Why are you ignoring me?

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.420
Well, if it isn't my 
self-proclaimed rival, Yunyun.

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.510
Don't say it's self-proclaimed!

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.640
Oh? Is that wrong?

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
I-It is! I really am your rival!

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:44.440
<i>This is a Crimson Demon girl 
we've recently gotten to know.</i>

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:46.650
<i>She calls herself Megumin's rival,</i>

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:49.020
<i>and challenges her every time 
they run into each other, but...</i>

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.650
Now, Megumin,

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:54.780
it's a complete and total coincidence 
that we met here, but no matter!

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:57.410
Today we're settling this!

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:47.250
<b>Episode 11</b>

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:47.250
<b>"God's Blessings On This Wonderful Choker!"</b>

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:30.920
Come on! Come on!

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:34.210
Settle what, exactly?

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:37.630
I've won nearly every contest 
you've challenged me to.

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:39.590
Sh-Shut up, you!

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:41.840
Sorry...

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:45.350
We'll do this outside so we won't 
cause trouble in your store.

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:46.220
Oh, it's okay.

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:49.600
I know that the reason 
you started shopping here

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:53.730
was because you heard that Megumin-san 
and her friends come by sometimes.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:56.690
E-Excuse me!

00:02:56.690 --> 00:03:00.280
I'd like to buy this today! 
What a cool-looking choker!

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:04.990
<i>Wait, has she been coming here all 
the time hoping to run into Megumin?</i>

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:08.410
Look, Yunyun... I mean...

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:11.870
You can always just visit 
our mansion, all right?

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:13.790
What? R-Really?

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:17.550
But if I show up with snacks and drinks, 
you won't look at me like,

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:21.180
"Wow, you actually came? Can't you 
tell when someone is just being nice?"

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:23.680
and act really annoyed, will you?

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:26.430
You are as irritating as ever!

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:29.100
If you want to come by, just do it whenever!

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:33.900
So, what are we going to do? 
Aren't we having a contest?

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:35.610
Hang on, Megumin!

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:40.990
I don't get to talk to this 
many people very often.

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:43.530
Can the contest wait 
until this evening, maybe?

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.000
You can never make up your mind, can you?

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.740
That's the problem with you loner types!

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:50.500
Hey, can I get some tea over here?

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.620
And something to eat, while you're at it.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:55.920
Right, Aqua-sama! 
I'll grab something right away!

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.130
Are you okay?!

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:02.300
Sorry! I'm all right!

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:05.760
Hey, we're losing daylight here!

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:08.140
This bunch is always so noisy...

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.390
Are you okay?

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.600
I could really go for some comfort.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:14.440
What's this?

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:19.820
"An uncharacteristically popular 
item sold at our shop."

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:22.740
"A choker that can grant wishes."

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:26.320
I'm not sure a shop should say an item's
popularity is "uncharacteristic"...

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:29.660
And the price is a relatively 
steep 100,000 eris.

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:32.250
What are these?! 
What are these boobs of yours?!

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:33.620
Have they grown again?!

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.080
Are you showing them off?!

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:39.040
Cut it out! Don't get mad at me 
just because yours won't grow!

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:36.540
Damn you!

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:39.670
They're so bouncy!

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:42.300
Uh, excuse me. This tea is barely warm.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:45.050
This is the problem with you undead
and your low body temperatures...

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:47.010
I'm so sorry, Aqua-sama!

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:50.260
What is this "potion that attracts beasts"?

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:52.850
F-For instance, would it make 
men who are beastlike

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:55.060
in certain ways find you more attractive?

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:58.770
It's a potion that attracts 
beast-type monsters.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:02.320
It makes monsters attack you one after 
another, without a moment's rest.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:03.780
I'll take it!

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:06.320
Huh? Are you sure?

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:08.160
You really won't have a moment's rest...

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:12.330
So it's an item that increases
your luck when equipped?

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:15.660
K-Kazuma-san!

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:18.460
Th-Th-That's...

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:21.550
Oh, the wish-granting choker?

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:24.260
Should I not have tried it on?

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:27.630
Th-That's a magic item that stays 
on until your wish comes true,

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:30.550
and it tightens every day 
that wish isn't granted!

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:32.390
You mean it's cursed?!

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:35.810
No, it's not! It's really popular with women!

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:39.770
It helps them get really, really 
motivated to lose weight...

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:43.780
<i>You have to grant your wish yourself? 
Is this some kind of joke?!</i>

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:47.530
So what did you wish for anyway, Kazuma?

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:51.530
Well, I didn't even wish for 
anything in particular.

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:53.450
That's bad, Kazuma-san!

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:56.910
If we don't do something, the choker will 
gradually tighten, and in four days...

00:05:56.910 --> 00:06:00.170
You're saying I'm gonna die because 
of some stupid dieting gimmick?!

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:01.960
It's my fault.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:06.220
Kazuma-san picked up that choker 
because I dropped it, and now he's...

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:09.590
It's my fault for yelling at you, too, Yunyun.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:13.470
No, if Wiz hadn't been 
distracted by Aqua and me...

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:15.430
I'm sorry, Kazuma.

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:17.770
It's really my fault!

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:21.940
I shouldn't have left something 
so dangerous on the store shelf.

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:25.860
Kazuma-san...

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:29.660
I'll do whatever it takes 
to get that choker off.

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:31.200
Don't worry!

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:32.990
I'll help, too!

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:35.790
Wh-When the Crimson Demons' greatest 
sorceress prodigy gets to work,

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:37.830
removing a magic item 
like that is child's play!

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:39.750
You'll have my help, as well!

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:44.750
Hey, I didn't do anything wrong!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.710
But just for the record...

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:50.510
Sorry! If you die, I'll be sure 
to cast Resurrection on you.

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:55.810
Maybe I won't come back 
to life next time I die.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:57.390
I'll go on strike from living.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:59.060
Wh-What are you saying?

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:01.900
Don't the two of us have 
to slay the Devil King?

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:06.780
Not to mention, if I die, you take sole 
possession of our considerable debt.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:08.860
Fine!

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:10.780
You just want me to help, too, right?!

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:14.740
We'll do whatever you want 
until that choker comes off!

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:18.120
Did you just say "whatever you want"?

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:25.710
U-Um, Kazuma-san?

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:26.500
Kazuma here.

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:29.590
I-Is it... comfortable?

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:33.340
Your thighs are nice and cool, Wiz.

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:35.470
And very soft.

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:36.430
Plus...

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:40.140
Seeing how embarrassed 
it makes you is great.

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:41.690
I-I see...

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:44.520
Well, um... th-thank you?

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:47.570
<i>A wish-granting choker...</i>

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:49.900
<i>This is much better than I thought!</i>

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:52.660
<i>I've got four whole days 
until it strangles me.</i>

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.320
<i>I'm sure it'll work out.</i>

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:58.790
It's only his first wish, and he's already 
putting his lust on full display.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:07:59.870
Very well!

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.960
I don't know what it is you want,

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:03.500
but I can deal with anything you—

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:06.040
Ditch the armor and give me 100 push-ups.

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:19.220
One... two...

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:22.020
three... four...

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:25.560
five... six...

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:28.070
seven...

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:29.230
Now this isn't bad at all.

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:32.740
I-I'm being exposed to his 
animalistic, hungry gaze

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:35.030
with no means of escape!

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:37.530
In his head, I'm surely being reduced

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:39.790
to an even more shameful state...

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:42.500
St—

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.670
Stop it!

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:49.420
And yet... as a knight, I must not yield!

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:50.960
Unbelievable...

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:56.550
He's going to use beautiful girls like us 
to fulfill his every twisted desire!

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.390
Go grab me a yakisoba bun, 
and make it snappy.

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:02.220
Why?!

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:04.020
Aqua-sama!

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:06.350
Now, then...

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:09.940
You two are rivals, right?

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:11.610
No, that's just Yunyun's idea.

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:14.450
The two of you are going to 
have a little competition.

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:19.580
W-Well, if you insist! 
I challenge you, Megumin!

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:21.870
Why are you so happy about this?

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:25.120
I will decide the contest,

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:28.750
and the winner will be chosen 
at my discretion, as I see fit.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:34.590
Excuse me...

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:41.430
Shouldn't you be face-up when 
using someone's lap as a pillow?

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:44.930
Where I was born, we do 
it like this sometimes.

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:46.850
R-Really?

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:47.850
'ere you ahr!

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:50.650
Too slow! And I think you mean, 
"I brought your food, sir!"

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:51.900
Fuhd, shur!

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:56.950
Hey...

00:09:57.530 --> 00:09:59.160
You ate half of this, didn't you?

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:01.330
Dih noth!

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:03.910
She's got her cheeks stuffed 
like a damn squirrel!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.250
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:11.340
It is the law of this world to grant me victory.

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:19.760
What are those two doing?

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:21.100
Strip rock-paper-scissors.

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:24.770
You are shockingly straightforward 
with what you want, aren't you?

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:27.100
Even I'm creeped out by that.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:30.600
Yunyun... At this rate, 
we're both going to suffer.

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:35.320
A-As the one who'll lead the 
Crimson Demons one day,

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:37.860
I can't afford to lose to you, Megumin!

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:40.490
You decide to be stubborn <i>now</i>?!

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:44.410
You're not planning to have 
me do that next, are you?

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:46.750
Next, go buy some expensive bubbly.

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:49.580
Why?!

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:51.630
Aqua-sama!

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:54.210
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:57.670
One more time! One more time!

00:10:57.670 --> 00:10:59.550
Again! Again! Again!

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:02.010
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:06.600
One more time! One more time!

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:10.100
If you tie three more times, 
you both have to take something off.

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:17.570
Yunyun...

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.320
I have faith in you.

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:23.450
You're my rival, and my friend.

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:26.240
I know you wouldn't be led 
astray by what he says.

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.250
Megumin...

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:30.960
I have faith in you, too.

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:34.840
Let's go! One more time!

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:45.680
What?! Are you just mad because you lost?!

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:48.850
Hey! Stop that! I'm going to fall out!

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:50.520
Stop it already!

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:53.850
Um, uh, Kazuma-san, 
should you stop them?

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:55.360
Wiz...

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:57.360
I can't help it.

00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:01.240
This is the only way to get 
the choker to come off.

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:04.450
I guess you're right...

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:07.240
Thank you for being so understanding.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:08.990
Kazuma!

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:11.000
I've finished the hundred push-ups!

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:14.920
I didn't think you'd leave me alone in there.

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:16.880
The humiliation and isolation were so—

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:18.630
Next up is 100 sit-ups.

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:23.380
KONOSUBA!

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:35.440
I've been defiled... I'm a goddess, 
but I've been defiled...

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:41.440
Um... Has the choker come off yet?

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:43.950
It's terribly unfortunate,

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:47.450
but it looks like we'll have to keep making 
my wishes come true tomorrow, too.

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:52.000
KO! NO! SU! BA!

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:55.460
KONOSUBA!

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:03.800
<i>After that, I continued to grant all 
the wishes I could come up with.</i>

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:06.470
Why am I doing this?

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:10.260
More exercise today?

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:14.640
This is embarrassing...

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:17.900
Something about this choice of 
clothing seems malicious to me.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:25.030
Oh, nice! Okay, next!

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:38.420
I just have to wash myself?

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:41.170
Yes. Nothing more.

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:43.550
And I will watch!

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:46.800
You're going to defile the goddess 
again today, aren't you?

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:48.930
What are you going to make me do?

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:51.390
I want you to find us a natural hot spring.

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.810
You can do that, right?

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:54.640
Huh? Why?

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:56.350
You're a water goddess, aren't you?

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:59.100
Wait, I'm sorry. It was the 
goddess of party tricks, wasn't it?

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:00.560
Fine! I'll do it!

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:04.740
I'll show you what a goddess can do!

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:07.660
A-Are you itchy anywhere?

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:11.330
If I had to say, maybe in front.

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:13.950
What? Your d***?

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:15.500
Just rip that thing off.

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:22.040
Oh, I think the choker's starting to tighten.

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:26.720
What should I do? Am I gonna die?

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:30.590
Go on! Go on, do it!

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:32.140
Go on, now!

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:34.720
What're you you so scared of? 
You're the one who mentioned my d***!

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:34.430
Megumin!

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:37.520
Go on! Rip it off! Hurry it up, now!

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:38.730
Try and rip it off!

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:40.270
My d***!

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:41.560
It's coming... I can sense it...

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:42.980
Go on!

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:45.610
Quickly, now!

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:48.110
Go ahead!

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:50.820
Here it comes!

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:03.090
KO! NO! SU! BA!

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:09.840
Why won't it come off?

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:13.390
Every wish I can think of has been granted...

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:18.560
All the wishes you could 
think up were perverted?

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:21.480
What am I missing?

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:25.110
Wiz, could you give me something to drink?

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:25.940
Oh, okay.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.320
From your mouth, I mean.

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:30.740
Oh, enough!

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:32.360
Tomorrow's the fourth day!

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:35.330
It seems pretty clear that your 
disgusting wishes aren't working!

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:36.700
What was that, you useless goddess?!

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:40.370
Maybe my specialty magic, 
Light of Saber, could do something...

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.660
You sure you're not just doing 
a bad job granting them?!

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:40.620
I've been doing my best, for your information!

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:41.540
I get it.

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:42.370
And how dare you call it disgusting?!

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:45.500
Then, after we've cut Kazuma's head off, 
we can easily remove the choker?

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:45.340
Taking a drink from a girl's 
mouth is the dream of every man!

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:46.960
He'd be dead!

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:50.340
I just wondered if there was a 
way to cut only the choker off!

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:51.840
Kazuma! Kazuma!

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:54.180
You're being gradually strangled...

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:55.600
What's it feel like?!

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:57.260
Is it the best, Kazuma?!

00:15:57.260 --> 00:16:00.140
Is the grip slowly tightening 
around you fantastic?!

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:01.390
Stop it!

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:03.560
Isn't there anything else you want?

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:09.570
I can't think of anything.

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:11.950
Well, you'd better come up with something!

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:14.820
I can't afford to have you die!

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:26.250
Tomorrow's the last day...

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:29.880
Oh, it's you, Yunyun.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:36.260
Why are you trying so hard 
for Kazuma-san's sake?

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:39.890
If Kazuma is gone,

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:43.980
who will carry me home after 
I've used my explosion magic?

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:48.150
His existence is a necessity 
for my mastery of explosions!

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:51.570
Besides...

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:23.060
Kazuma is my friend.

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:25.020
The greatest mind of the Crimson Demons

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:27.150
would never forsake a friend.

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:29.940
I understand.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:33.860
I'm partly responsible for 
what happened to him, too.

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:35.900
Let's make sure we 
get that choker off him!

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:40.330
There's no telling what awful 
things he'll have you do.

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:43.290
I-It's okay, as long as I'm with you!

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:46.870
N-Now, I didn't mean anything by that!

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:56.840
Thanks, everyone.

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:59.260
I had a great time.

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:04.640
Uh... Do you have any more terrible 
commands, like yesterday?

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:05.930
It's fine.

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:08.480
Thanks for indulging me.

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:10.020
I'm really grateful.

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:14.490
A-All I did was exercise and wash myself!

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:17.740
You could always give me nastier... orders?

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:22.620
I have lived a very shameful life.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:27.080
Living every moment for your desires 
leaves nothing but emptiness.

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:30.830
Do scumbags lose the will to live 
once all their desires are sated?

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:35.840
Once I'm dead, you can have this tracksuit.

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:39.680
Let it be the proof that 
I lived in this world.

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:41.890
H-Hang on...

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:43.680
Aqua.

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:49.190
The yakisoba bun and bubbly you bought

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:51.480
were very delicious.

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:04.200
Kazuma-san...

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:06.290
Kazuma...

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:07.450
Kazuma-san...

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:08.500
Kazuma...

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:20.220
Don't die, Kazuma.

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:23.470
We're going to bring down the 
Devil King together, right?

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:24.720
True...

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:27.930
I won't let you die!

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:30.980
Please... You can ask for anything!

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:36.280
<i>This is what it feels 
like to be comforted?</i>

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:44.120
I see.

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:48.000
Then, since it's the end, there are 
some things I'd like to apologize for.

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:51.000
Megumin...

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:55.670
When I would carry you home 
after you used explosion magic,

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:58.590
I tried to get a feel for your 
breasts as much as possible

00:19:58.590 --> 00:20:01.470
by shaking you around and 
changing my posture a lot.

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:03.760
I'm sorry.

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:06.060
Yunyun, Wiz...

00:20:06.060 --> 00:20:08.220
If I'm being honest, 
whenever I talk with you two,

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:11.730
my line of sight is fixed on your chests.

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:13.100
Wiz has so much to look at,

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:15.730
and Yunyun's outfit is so 
sexy around the chest.

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:19.780
And I actually thought it was your 
fault, for having bodies like that.

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:21.530
I'm sorry.

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:22.610
Darkness...

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:25.740
Since we started living together here,

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:27.700
all I've really seen you as is boobs.

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:30.200
You are boobs.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:31.540
Boobs.

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:33.960
Sorry.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:38.210
You're going to spout some heresy 
about a goddess like me, too?

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:41.340
Aqua, when we were sleeping 
in the horse stables...

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:49.310
I can't eat another bite...

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:54.900
I tried desperately to see you as some kind 
of love interest, but I just couldn't do it.

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:56.730
I'm sorry.

00:20:57.560 --> 00:20:59.980
Don't give up so easily, Kazuma-san!

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:01.780
Don't give up!

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:03.450
Please, I'm begging you!

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:05.780
I have no regrets left.

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:07.830
Thank you all for everything.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:14.120
Huh? Why?

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:19.840
I could really go for some comfort.

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:24.680
<i>My wish... was to be comforted?</i>

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:32.100
<i>Uh, everyone, that's the 
look you save for garbage.</i>

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:34.350
Hey, crappy NEET.

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:37.860
Why don't you try putting 
this choker on again?

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:42.820
It's okay. Your kind friends 
are sure to help you out.

00:21:56.170 --> 00:21:57.490
Well...

00:21:57.490 --> 00:21:59.590
Can I just say one thing?

00:22:00.510 --> 00:22:01.750
Go ahead.

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:06.200
Try not to die over something as silly as this.

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:09.040
I have no excuse!
